tivities in an organization. [view profile »](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/management/computer-and-information-systems-managers.htm) * [Financial Managers](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/management/financial-managers.htm) Financial Managers Financial managers create financial reports, direct investment activities, and develop plans for the long-term financial goals of their organization. [view"}
