/entertainment-and-sports/actors.htm) * [Producers and Directors](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/entertainment-and-sports/producers-and-directors.htm) Producers and Directors Producers and directors make business and creative decisions about film, television, stage, and other productions. [view profile »](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/entertainment-and-sports/producers-and-directors.htm) * [Athletes and Sports Competitors](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/entertainment-and-sports/athletes-and-sports-competitors.htm) Athletes and Sports Competitors Athletes and sports competitors participate in organized, officiated sporting events to entertain spectators. [view profile »](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/entertainment-and-sports/athletes-and-sports-competitors.htm) * [Coaches and Scouts](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/entertainment-and-sports/coaches-and-scouts.htm) Coaches and Scouts Coaches teach amateur or professional athletes the skills they need to succeed at their sport. Scouts evaluate athletes as possible recruits. [view profile »](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/entertainment-and-sports/coaches-and-scouts.htm) * [Umpires, Referees, and Other Sports Officials](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/entertainment-and-sports/umpires-referees-and-other-sports-officials.htm) Umpires, Referees, and Other Sports Officials Umpires, referees, and other sports officials preside over competitive athletic or sporting events to help maintain standards of play. [view profile »](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/entertainment-and-sports/umpires-referees-and-other-sports-officials.htm) * [Dancers and Choreographers](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/entertainment-and-sports/dancers-and-choreographers.htm) Dancers and Choreographers Dancers and choreographers use dance performances to express ideas and stories. [view profile »](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/entertainment-and-sports/dancers-and-choreographers.htm) * [](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/entertainment-and-sports/music-directors-and-composers.htm) Music Directors and Composers Music directors lead musical groups during performances and recording sessions. Composers write and arrange music in a variety of musical styles. [view profile »](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/entertainment-and-sports/music-directors-and-composers.htm) * [Musicians and Singers](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/entertainment-and-sports/musicians-and-singers.htm) Musicians and Singers Musicians and singers play instruments or sing for live audiences and in recording studios. [view profile »](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/entertainment-and-sports/musicians-and-singers.htm) * [Announcers and DJs](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/media-and-communication/announcers.htm) Announcers and DJs Announcers present news and sports or may interview guests on media such as radio and television. Disc jockeys (DJs) act as masters of ceremonies (emcees) or play recorded music at weddings, parties, or clubs. [view profile »](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/media-and-communication/announcers.htm) * [News Analysts, Reporters, and Journalists](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/media-and-communication/reporters-correspondents-and-broadcast-news-analysts.htm) News Analysts, Reporters, and Journalists News analysts, reporters, and journalists keep the public updated about current events and noteworthy information. [view profile »](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/media-and-communication/reporters-correspondents-and-broadcast-news-analysts.htm) * [Editors](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/media-and-communication/editors.htm) Editors Editors plan, review, and revise content for publication. [view profile »](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/media-and-communication/editors.htm) * [Technical Writers](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/media-and-communication/technical-writers.htm) Technical Writers Technical writers prepare instruction manuals, how-to guides, journal articles, and other supporting documents to communicate complex and technical information more easily. [view profile »](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/media-and-communication/technical-writers.htm) * [Writers and Authors](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/media-