und, and Video Technicians Broadcast, sound, and video technicians set up, operate, and maintain the electrical equipment for media programs. [view profile »](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/media-and-communication/broadcast-and-sound-engineering-technicians.htm) * [Photographers](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/media-and-communication/photographers.htm) Photographers Photographers use their technical expertise and creativity to produce and preserve images of people, landscapes, merchandise, or other subjects. [view profile »](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/media-and-communication/photographers.htm) * [Film and Video Editors and Camera Operators](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/media-and-communication/film-and-video-editors-and-camera-operators.htm) Film and Video Editors and Camera Operators Film and video editors and camera operators manipulate moving images that entertain or inform an audience. [view profile »](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/media-and-communication/film-and-video-editors-and-camera-operators.htm) * [Chiropractors](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/healthcare/chiropractors.htm) Chiropractors Chiropractors assess, treat, and care for patients by manipulating the spine and musculoskeletal system. [view profile »](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/healthcare/chiropractors.htm) * [Dentists](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/healthcare/dentists.htm) Dentists Dentists diagnose and treat problems with patients’ teeth, gums, and related parts of the mouth. [view profile »](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/healthcare/dentists.htm) * [Optometrists](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/healthcare/optometrists.htm) Optometrists Optometrists diagnose, manage, and treat conditions and diseases of the human eye and visual system, including examining eyes and prescribing corrective lenses. [view profile »](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/healthcare/optometrists.htm) * [Pharmacists](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/healthcare/pharmacists.htm) Pharmacists Pharmacists dispense prescription medications and provide information to patients about the drugs and their use. [vi