ents who have cancer or other serious diseases. [view profile »](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/healthcare/radiation-therapists.htm) * [Recreational Therapists](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/healthcare/recreational-therapists.htm) Recreational Therapists Recreational therapists plan, direct,"}
