ans-and-medical-appliance-technicians.htm) Dental and Ophthalmic Laboratory Technicians and Medical Appliance Technicians Dental and ophthalmic laboratory technicians and medical appliance technicians make or repair dentures, eyeglasses, prosthetics, and related products. [view"}
