ta scientists use analytical tools and techniques to extract meaningful insights from data. [view profile »](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/math/data-scientists.htm) * [Project Management Specialists](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/business-and-financial/project-management-specialists.htm) Project Management Specialists Project management specialists coordinate the budget, schedule, staffing, and other details of a project. [view profile »](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/business-and-financial/project-management-specialists.htm) * [Health Information Technologists and Medical Registrars](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/healthcare/health-information-technologists-and-medical-registrars.htm) Health Information Technologists and Medical Registrars Health information technologists and medical registrars advise organizations on computerized healthcare systems and analyze clinical data. [view profile »](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/healthcare/health-information-technologists-and-medical-registrars.htm) * [Tutors](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/education-training-and-library/tutors.htm) Tutors Tutors instruct students individually or in small groups to support formal class instruction or improve academic performance. Some tutors prepare students for standardized tests. [view profile »](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/education-training-and-library/tutors.htm) * [Taxi Drivers, Shuttle Drivers, and Chauffeurs](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/transportation-and-material-moving/taxi-drivers-and-chauffeurs.htm) Taxi Drivers, Shuttle Drivers, and Chauffeurs Taxi drivers (including ride-hailing drivers), shuttle drivers, and chauffeurs transport people to and from the places they need to go. [view profile »](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/transportation-and-material-moving/taxi-drivers-and-chauffeurs.htm) * [Community Health Workers](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/community-and-social-service/community-health-workers.htm) Community Health Workers Community health workers promote wellness by helping people in their communities adopt healthy behaviors. They implement programs and advocate for people who may have limited access to health resources and social services. [view profile »](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/community-and-social-service/community-health-workers.htm) * [Medical Dosimetrists](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/healthcare/medical-dosimetrists.htm) Medical Dosimetrists Medical dosimetrists calculate doses of radiation and design and oversee treatment plans for patients with cancer and other serious diseases. [view profile »](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/healthcare/medical-dosimetrists.htm) * [Calibration Technologists and Technicians](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/installation-maintenance-and-repair/calibration-technologists-and-technicians.htm) Calibration Technologists and Technicians Calibration technologists and technicians inspect, adjust, and test measurement devices against standards, such as those used in manufacturing, healthcare, and other industries. [view profile »](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/installation-maintenance-and-repair/calibration-technologists-and-technicians.htm) * [Entertainment and Recreation Managers](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/management/entertainment-and-recreation-managers.htm) Entertainment and Recreation Managers Entertainment and recreation managers plan, direct, and coordinate activities and operations related to fitness and leisure. [view profile »](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/management/entertainment-and-recreation-managers.htm) * [Credit Counselors](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/business-and-financial/credit-counselors.htm) Credit Counselors Credit counselors advise and educate individuals or organizations on acquiring and managing debt. They also may provide guidance on credit issues and on budgeting, mortgages, or student financial aid packages. [view profile »](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/business-and-financial/credit-counselors.htm) * [Compliance Officers](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/business-and-financial/compliance-officers.htm) Compliance Officers Compliance officers make sure that people and organizations meet legal and regulatory requirements. [view profile »](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/business-and-financial/compliance-officers.htm) * [Transportation, Storage, and Distribution Managers](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/management/transportation-storage-and-distribution-managers.htm)"}
{"source_id": "CP-S001", "chunk_id": "CP-S001-0025", "chunk_index": 24, "publisher": "BLS", "title": "Occupational Outlook Handbook", "category": "labor_market", "topics": ["career", "occupations", "wages", "outlook"], "url": "https://www.bls.gov/ooh/", "resolved_url": "https://www.bls.gov/ooh/", "retrieval_method": "reader_fallback", "fetched_at": "2026-09-21T14:55:41.718343+00:00", "http_status": 403, "content_type": "text/plain", "word_count": 311, "text": "and operations related to fitness and leisure. [view profile »](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/management/entertainment-and-recreation-managers.htm) * [Credit Counselors](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/business-and-financial/credit-counselors.htm) Credit Counselors Credit counselors advise and educate individuals or organizations on acquiring and managing debt. They also may provide guidance on credit issues and on budgeting, mortgages, or student financial aid packages. [view profile »](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/business-and-financial/credit-counselors.htm) * [Compliance Officers](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/business-and-financial/compliance-officers.htm) Compliance Officers Compliance officers make sure that people and organizations meet legal and regulatory requirements. [view profile »](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/business-and-financial/compliance-officers.htm) * [Transportation, Storage, and Distribution Managers](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/management/transportation-storage-and-distribution-managers.htm) Transportation, Storage, and Distribution Managers Transportation, storage, and distribution managers plan, direct, or coordinate the movement of people and goods. [view profile »](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/management/transportation-storage-and-distribution-managers.htm) * [Set and Exhibit Designers](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/arts-and-design/set-and-exhibit-designers.htm) Set and Exhibit Designers Set and exhibit designers develop visual and tactile spaces for entertainment productions or for a variety of displays. [view profile »](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/arts-and-design/set-and-exhibit-designers.htm) * [Semiconductor Processing Technicians](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/production/semiconductor-processing-technicians.htm) Semiconductor Processing Technicians Semiconductor processing technicians perform tasks in the manufacture of electronic semiconductors, commonly known as integrated circuits or microchips, that are used in cars, smartphones, and other everyday devices. [view profile »](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/production/semiconductor-processing-technicians.htm) * [Oil and Gas Workers](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/construction-and-extraction/oil-and-gas-workers.htm) Oil and Gas Workers Oil and gas workers assemble, operate, and maintain equipment used for oil and gas exploration, extraction, and related activities. [view profile »](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/construction-and-extraction/oil-and-gas-workers.htm) * [Concierges](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/personal-care-and-service/concierges.htm) Concierges Concierges help people at hotels, apartments, or office buildings with a variety of personal services. [view profile »](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/personal-care-and-service/concierges.htm) * [Tour and Travel Guides](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/personal-care-and-service/tour-and-travel-guides.htm) Tour and Travel Guides Tour and travel guides lead individuals or groups on excursions to various points of interest, including historical locations, museums, and monuments. [view profile »](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/personal-care-and-service/tour-and-travel-guides.htm) * [Cardiovascular Technologists and Technicians](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/healthcare/cardiovascular-technologists-and-technicians.htm) Cardiovascular Technologists and Technicians Cardiovascular technologists and technicians conduct tests and assist in procedures involving the heart or lungs. [view profile »](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/healthcare/cardiovascular-technologists-and-technicians.htm) * [Recreational Protective Service Workers](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/protective-service/recreational-protective-service-workers.htm) Recreational Protective Service Workers Recreational protective service workers monitor recreational areas, such as pools, beaches, or ski slopes, to provide aid and protection to participants. [view profile »](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/protective-service/recreational-protective-service-workers.htm)"}
{"source_id": "CP-S002", "chunk_id": "CP-S002-0001", "chunk_index": 0, "publisher": "BLS", "title": "Computer and Information Technology Occupations", "category": "labor_market", "topics": ["technology", "occupations", "wages"], "url": "https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/", "resolved_url": "https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/", "retrieval_method": "reader_fallback", "fetched_at": "2026-09-21T14:55:41.718627+00:00", "http_status": 403, "content_type": "text/plain", "word_count": 450, "text": "Title: Computer and Information Technology Occupations URL Source: https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/ Markdown Content: These workers create or support computer applications, systems, and networks. Overall employment in computer and information technology occupations is projected to grow faster than the average for all occupations from 2025 to 2035. About 280,000 openings are projected each year, on average, in these occupations due to employment growth and the need to replace workers who leave the occupations permanently. The median annual wage for this group was $109,470 in May 2025, which was higher than the median annual wage for all occupations of $50,980. BLS employment projections, wage, and other data for related occupations not shown in the following table are available on the[Data for Occupations Not Covered in Detail](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/about/data-for-occupations-not-covered-in-detail.htm#Computer%20and%20mathematical%20occupations)page. Information highlighting physical demands, cognitive and mental requirements, and other qualifications for workers in this group are available in a BLS [Occupational Requirements Survey](https://www.bls.gov/ors/factsheet/pdf/computer-and-mathematical-occupations.pdf) (ORS) profile. | Image | OCCUPATION | JOB SUMMARY | ENTRY-LEVEL EDUCATION [![Image 1: Help](https://www.bls.gov/images/icons/icon_small_help.gif)](https://www.bls.gov/#TB_inline?height=325&width=325&inlineId=inlinehelp-education) | 2025 MEDIAN PAY [![Image 2: Help](https://www.bls.gov/images/icons/icon_small_help.gif)](https://www.bls.gov/#TB_inline?height=325&width=325&inlineId=inlinehelp-pay) | | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | | [![Image 3: Computer and information research scientists](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/images/1504.jpg)](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/computer-and-information-research-scientists.htm) | **[Computer and Information Research Scientists](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/computer-and-information-research-scientists.htm)** | Computer and information research scientists design innovative uses for new and existing computing technology. | Master's degree | $140,300 | | [![Image 4: computer network architects image](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/images/15198.jpg)](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/computer-network-architects.htm) | **[Computer Network Architects](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/computer-network-architects.htm)** | Computer network architects design and implement data communication networks, including local area networks (LANs), wide area networks (WANs), and intranets. | Bachelor's degree | $134,050 | | [![Image 5: Computer programmers](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/images/1790.jpg)](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/computer-programmers.htm) | **[Computer Programmers](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/computer-programmers.htm)** | Computer programmers write, modify, and test code and scripts that allow computer software and applications to function properly. | Bachelor's degree | $100,390 | | [![Image 6: Computer support specialists](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/images/1800.jpg)](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/computer-support-specialists.htm) | **[Computer Support Specialists](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/computer-support-specialists.htm)** | Computer support specialists maintain computer networks and provide technical help to computer users. | [See How to Become One](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/computer-support-specialists.htm#tab-4) | $62,890 | | [![Image 7: Computer systems analysts](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/images/1806.jpg)](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/computer-systems-analysts.htm) | **[Computer Systems Analysts](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/computer-systems-analysts.htm)** | Computer systems analysts study an organization’s current computer systems and design ways to improve efficiency. | Bachelor's degree | $105,850 | | [![Image 8: Database administrators](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/images/1809.jpg)](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/database-administrators.htm) | **[Database Administrators and Architects](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/database-administrators.htm)** | Database administrators and architects create or organize systems to store and secure data. | Bachelor's degree | $126,760 | | [![Image 9: Information security analysts](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/images/1824.jpg)](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/information-security-analysts.htm) | **[Information Security Analysts](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/information-security-analysts.htm)** | Information security analysts plan and carry out security measures to protect an organization’s computer networks and systems. | Bachelor's degree | $129,180 | | [![Image 10: Network and computer systems administrators](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/images/1816.jpg)](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/network-and-computer-systems-administrators.htm) | **[Network and Computer Systems Administrators](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/network-and-computer-systems-administrators.htm)** | Network and computer systems administrators install, configure, and maintain organizations’ computer networks and systems. | Bachelor's degree | $99,130 |"}
{"source_id": "CP-S002", "chunk_id": "CP-S002-0002", "chunk_index": 1, "publisher": "BLS", "title": "Computer and Information Technology Occupations", "category": "labor_market", "topics": ["technology", "occupations", "wages"], "url": "https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/", "resolved_url": "https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/", "retrieval_method": "reader_fallback", "fetched_at": "2026-09-21T14:55:41.718627+00:00", "http_status": 403, "content_type": "text/plain", "word_count": 162, "text": "| Bachelor's degree | $126,760 | | [![Image 9: Information security analysts](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/images/1824.jpg)](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/information-security-analysts.htm) | **[Information Security Analysts](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/information-security-analysts.htm)** | Information security analysts plan and carry out security measures to protect an organization’s computer networks and systems. | Bachelor's degree | $129,180 | | [![Image 10: Network and computer systems administrators](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/images/1816.jpg)](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/network-and-computer-systems-administrators.htm) | **[Network and Computer Systems Administrators](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/network-and-computer-systems-administrators.htm)** | Network and computer systems administrators install, configure, and maintain organizations’ computer networks and systems. | Bachelor's degree | $99,130 | | [![Image 11: Software developers](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/images/1796.jpg)](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/software-developers.htm) | **[Software Developers, Quality Assurance Analysts, and Testers](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/software-developers.htm)** | Software developers design computer applications or programs. Software quality assurance analysts and testers identify problems with applications or programs and report defects. | Bachelor's degree | $134,040 | | [![Image 12: Web developers](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/images/3433.jpg)](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/web-developers.htm) | **[Web Developers and Digital Designers](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/web-developers.htm)** | Web developers create and maintain websites. Digital designers develop, create, and test website or interface layout, functions, and navigation for usability. | Bachelor's degree | $99,520 | **Last modified date:** August 27, 2026"}
