.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/computer-and-information-research-scientists.htm) | **[Computer and Information Research Scientists](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/computer-and-information-research-scientists.htm)** | Computer and information research scientists design innovative uses for new and existing computing technology. | Master's degree | $140,300 | | [![Image 15: Computer and information systems managers](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/images/1597.jpg)](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/management/computer-and-information-systems-managers.htm) | **[Computer and Information Systems Managers](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/management/computer-and-information-systems-managers.htm)** | Computer and information systems managers plan, coordinate, and direct computer-related activities in an organization. | Bachelor's degree | $175,140 | | [![Image 16: computer network architects image](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/images/15198.jpg)](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/computer-network-architects.htm) | **[Computer Network Architects](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/computer-network-architects.htm)** | Computer network architects design and implement data communication networks, including local area networks (LANs), wide area networks (WANs), and intranets. | Bachelor's degree | $134,050 | | [![Image 17: Computer programmers](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/images/1790.jpg)](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/computer-programmers.htm) | **[Computer Programmers](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/computer-programmers.htm)** | Computer programmers write, modify, and test code and scripts that allow computer software and applications to function properly. | Bachelor's degree | $100,390 | | [![Image 18: Computer support specialists](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/images/1800.jpg)](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/computer-support-specialists.htm) | **[Computer Support Specialists](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/computer-support-specialists.htm)** | Computer support specialists maintain computer networks and provide technical help to computer users. | [See How to Become One](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/computer-support-specialists.htm#tab-4) | $62,890 | | [![Image 19: Computer systems analysts](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/images/1806.jpg)](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/computer-systems-analysts.htm) | **[Computer Systems Analysts](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/computer-systems-analysts.htm)** | Computer systems analysts study an organization’s current computer systems and design ways to improve efficiency. | Bachelor's degree | $105,850 | | [![Image 20: Database administrators](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/images/1809.jpg)](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/database-administrators.htm) | **[Database Administrators and Architects](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/database-administrators.htm)** | Database administrators and architects create or organize systems to store and secure data. | Bachelor's degree | $126,760 | | [![Image 21: Network and computer systems administrators](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/images/1816.jpg)](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/network-and-computer-systems-administrators.htm) | **[Network and Computer Systems Administrators](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/network-and-computer-systems-administrators.htm)** | Network and computer systems administrators install, configure, and maintain organizations’ computer networks and systems. | Bachelor's degree | $99,130 | | [![Image 22: Software developers](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/images/1796.jpg)](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/software-developers.htm) | **[Software Developers, Quality Assurance Analysts, and Testers](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/software-developers.htm)** | Software developers design computer applications or programs. Software quality assurance analysts and testers identify problems with applications or programs and report defects. | Bachelor's degree | $134,040 | | [![Image 23: Web developers](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/images/3433.jpg)](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/web-developers.htm) | **[Web Developers and Digital Designers](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/web-developers.htm)** | Web developers create and maintain websites. Digital designers develop, create, and test website or interface layout, functions, and navigation for usability."}
{"source_id": "CP-S005", "chunk_id": "CP-S005-0009", "chunk_index": 8, "publisher": "BLS", "title": "Information Security Analysts", "category": "occupations", "topics": ["cybersecurity", "skills", "wages", "outlook"], "url": "https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/information-security-analysts.htm", "resolved_url": "https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/information-security-analysts.htm", "retrieval_method": "reader_fallback", "fetched_at": "2026-09-21T14:55:41.719182+00:00", "http_status": 403, "content_type": "text/plain", "word_count": 450, "text": "| [![Image 22: Software developers](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/images/1796.jpg)](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/software-developers.htm) | **[Software Developers, Quality Assurance Analysts, and Testers](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/software-developers.htm)** | Software developers design computer applications or programs. Software quality assurance analysts and testers identify problems with applications or programs and report defects. | Bachelor's degree | $134,040 | | [![Image 23: Web developers](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/images/3433.jpg)](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/web-developers.htm) | **[Web Developers and Digital Designers](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/web-developers.htm)** | Web developers create and maintain websites. Digital designers develop, create, and test website or interface layout, functions, and navigation for usability. | Bachelor's degree | $99,520 | [<- State & Area Data](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/information-security-analysts.htm#tab-7)[More Info ->](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/information-security-analysts.htm#tab-9) ## Contacts for More Information[About this section](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/information-security-analysts.htm#TB_inline?