omputer-systems-administrators.htm) | **[Network and Computer Systems Administrators](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/network-and-computer-systems-administrators.htm)** | Network and computer systems administrators install, configure, and maintain organizations’ computer networks and systems. | Bachelor's degree | $99,130 | | [![Image 24: Operations research analysts](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/images/1831.jpg)](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/math/operations-research-analysts.htm) | **[Operations Research Analysts](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/math/operations-research-analysts.htm)** | Operations research analysts use mathematics and logic to help solve complex issues. | Bachelor's degree | $88,940 | | [![Image 25: Software developers](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/images/1796.jpg)](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/software-developers.htm) | **[Software Developers, Quality Assurance Analysts, and Testers](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/software-developers.htm)** | Software developers design computer applications or programs. Software quality assurance analysts and testers identify problems with applications or programs and report defects. | Bachelor's degree | $134,040 | | [![Image 26: Web developers](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/images/3433.jpg)](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/web-developers.htm) | **[Web Developers and Digital Designers](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/web-developers.htm)** | Web developers create and maintain websites. Digital designers develop, create, and test website or interface layout, functions, and navigation for usability. | Bachelor's degree | $99,520 | [<- State & Area Data](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/computer-systems-analysts.htm#tab-7)[More Info ->](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/computer-systems-analysts.htm#tab-9) ## Contacts for More Information[About this s