op.org/Toolkit/Wages/find-salary.aspx?frd=true) to search for wages by zip code. [<- Job Outlook](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/computer-and-information-research-scientists.htm#tab-6)[Similar Occupations ->](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/computer-and-information-research-scientists.htm#tab-8) ## Similar Occupations[About this section](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/computer-and-information-research-scientists.htm#TB_inline?height=325&width=325&inlineId=about-similar-jobs) This table shows a list of occupations with job duties that are similar to those of computer and information research scientists. | | Occupation | Job Duties | ENTRY-LEVEL EDUCATION [![Image 12: Help on Median Pay](https://www.bls.gov/images/icons/icon_small_help.gif)](https://www.bls.gov/#TB_inline?height=325&width=325&inlineId=inlinehelp-education) | 2025 MEDIAN PAY [![Image 13: Help on Median Pay](https://www.bls.gov/images/icons/icon_small_help.gif)](https://www.bls.gov/#TB_inline?height=325&width=325&inlineId=inlinehelp-pay) | | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | | [![Image 14: Computer and information systems managers](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/images/1597.jpg)](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/management/computer-and-information-systems-managers.htm) | **[Computer and Information Systems Managers](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/management/computer-and-information-systems-managers.htm)** | Computer and information systems managers plan, coordinate, and direct computer-related activities in an organization. | Bachelor's degree | $175,140 | | [![Image 15: Worker examines computer component.](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/images/1885.jpg)](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/architecture-and-engineering/computer-hardware-engineers.htm) | **[Computer Hardware Engineers](https://www.bls.gov/ooh/architecture-and-engineering/computer-hardware-engineers.htm)** | Computer hardware engineers research, design, develop, and test computers and related equipm