{"source_id": "CP-S058", "chunk_id": "CP-S058-0001", "chunk_index": 0, "publisher": "Amazon Jobs", "title": "University Recruiting", "category": "internships", "topics": ["internships", "students"], "url": "https://amazon.jobs/content/en/career-programs/university/internships-for-students", "resolved_url": "https://amazon.jobs/content/en/career-programs/university/internships-for-students", "retrieval_method": "direct", "fetched_at": "2026-09-21T14:55:53.525464+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "text/html; charset=utf-8", "word_count": 450, "text": "Internships for Students Teams Locations Job categories Resources Accommodations Benefits Inclusive experiences Interviewing at Amazon Leadership Principles Working at Amazon FAQ Language: en-US Search Language: en-US Search for jobs Title or keyword Location Search Internships for Students We offer real-world experience, showing you just what it’s like to work at the highest-level, accelerating the progression of your career, and setting you up for success. As a student intern, the knowledge and skills you’ve gained during your studies will come to life. Find open internships As an intern with us, you'll... Create impact from day one Own your project from start to finish, shaping how millions of people shop and live. Your ideas matter here—no busywork. Develop skills that matter Learn through direct experience with emerging technologies and business innovation. Turn classroom knowledge into real results. Build your network Connect with talented interns and professionals worldwide. Join a community where collaboration drives innovation. Benefit from mentorship Your manager will pair you with a mentor who will support and coach you—they’re invested in your success. Our internships are for rising seniors and recent graduates with an undergraduate, master’s, or doctorate degree. Explore open roles Internship opportunities Explore different roles across Amazon while building your career foundation. Strong performance can lead to full-time opportunities. AWS Internships Pathways MBA Operations internships for students in Europe Operations Internships for Students in North America Science Software Development Engineer Technical Engineering Undergraduate Non-Tech Show more Download Amazon A to Z Whatever direction you want to go, you can get there faster at Amazon. Download the A to Z mobile app to explore the scale and scope of our company, apply for apprenticeships and internships, and learn how our culture empowers our people to do amazing work. Download for iOS Download for Android Testimonials Hear from recent interns At Amazon I’m given the flexibility to fail, in the sense that failure is not something to shy away from or be scared about. Nnedimkpa N. I’m very grateful for this opportunity, which is a fantastic head start to my career, and to make a positive impact in the industry. Pratik K. Amazon provided a lot of responsibility for me as an intern. I had to make changes to my team’s code base, and these changes had the potential to be pushed out to customers. I felt the work I was doing was impactful. Edward A. Video Power the future Download video transcript Hear from our graduates and interns about what it’s like to find belonging, explore opportunities worldwide, and be part of innovation at scale. Build the future with Amazon Rhondu Grew His Career from Amazon Intern to Software Engineer Download video transcript This former #amazonintern and Shakespeare enthusiast"}
