{"source_id": "CP-S073", "chunk_id": "CP-S073-0001", "chunk_index": 0, "publisher": "Adobe Careers", "title": "Adobe Students", "category": "internships", "topics": ["internships", "students"], "url": "https://www.adobe.com/careers/university.html", "resolved_url": "https://www.adobe.com/careers/university.html", "retrieval_method": "reader_fallback", "fetched_at": "2026-09-21T14:55:57.398650+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "text/plain", "word_count": 450, "text": "Title: University | Adobe URL Source: https://www.adobe.com/careers/university.html Markdown Content: ![Image 1: UniversityMarqueeHero](https://cdn.phenompeople.com/CareerConnectResources/ADOBUS/images/UniversityMarqueeHero-1766012328725.png) ## Make the move from university to Adobe. United States Join us as an intern or university grad and help us in empowering everyone to create. ## Widget title goes here Your engaging subtitle goes here. Provide a brief description or engaging subtitle that captures the essence of your content and encourages users to explore further. This text should be concise yet informative. ### Get a glimpse of Adobe Life as an intern. We offer internships throughout the company — in engineering, sales, marketing, and more — so you can do mission-critical work and start building a one-of-a-kind career. ![Image 2: internvideo_4x5_final](https://cdn.phenompeople.com/CareerConnectResources/ADOBUS/images/internvideo_4x5_final-1765405043610.png) Your engaging footer subtitle goes here. ## Widget title goes here. Your engaging subtitle goes here. Provide a brief description or engaging subtitle that captures the essence of your content and encourages users to explore further. This text should be concise yet informative. ### Intern with impact. Build with purpose. Build the tools that shape creativity. From generative AI to real-time collaboration, you'll contribute to products used by billions, solve real-world challenges, and work with some of the brightest minds in tech. ![Image 3: University1](https://cdn.phenompeople.com/CareerConnectResources/ADOBUS/images/University1-1763753411960.png) Your engaging footer subtitle goes here. ## Widget title goes here. Your engaging subtitle goes here. Provide a brief description or engaging subtitle that captures the essence of your content and encourages users to explore further. This text should be concise yet informative. ### Grow your career. Own the outcome. You can make an impact without writing code. Bring your bold ideas, drive, and clear voice to marketing, operations, strategy, and other non-technical roles. ![Image 4: University2](https://cdn.phenompeople.com/CareerConnectResources/ADOBUS/images/University2-1763753414010.png) Your engaging footer subtitle goes here. ![Image 5: University3](https://cdn.phenompeople.com/CareerConnectResources/ADOBUS/images/University3-1763753416399.png) ## Unlock your potential. Raise the bar. From Adobe Sales Academy and student athlete programming to Digital Academy certifications, we power your journey from intern to industry leader. We prioritize and support your growth along with the innovations we build. Explore [Adobe Sales Academy](https://careers.adobe.com/us/en/sales-academy) and [Adobe Digital Academy](https://www.adobe.com/corporate-responsibility/creativity/digital-academy.html) ## Widget title goes here. Your engaging subtitle goes here. Provide a brief description or engaging subtitle that captures the essence of your content and encourages users to explore further. This text should be concise yet informative. ### Everything at Adobe starts with our people. Adobe is a global company empowering people from all walks of life. Being genuinely yourself isn’t just welcomed — it’s essential to meeting the needs of all our customers. ![Image 6: University4](https://cdn.phenompeople.com/CareerConnectResources/ADOBUS/images/University4-1763753419450.png) Your engaging footer subtitle goes here. Card text ## Stay in the loop. Join a community of innovators and get early access to opportunities, insider insights, and exclusive updates on life at Adobe. [Join our talent community](https://careers.adobe.com/us/en/jointalentcommunity) ## Widget title"}
