{"source_id": "CP-S077", "chunk_id": "CP-S077-0001", "chunk_index": 0, "publisher": "Levels.fyi", "title": "Internships", "category": "salary", "topics": ["internships", "salary"], "url": "https://www.levels.fyi/internships/", "resolved_url": "https://www.levels.fyi/internships/", "retrieval_method": "direct", "fetched_at": "2026-09-21T14:55:57.792630+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "text/html; charset=utf-8", "word_count": 450, "text": "2026-2027 Tech Internship Guide & Salaries | Levels.fyi Currency Number Display Annual / Monthly 🇮🇳 INR - ₹ Indian Rupee Indic (Indian Sub) 10,00,000 - 10L 10,00,000 10L Annual Monthly For Employers $ USD / yr Sign In Sign Up $ USD / yr Change English (US) Change Inbox Notifications Profile $ USD / yr Change English (US) Change All Data By Location By Company By Title Salary Heatmap Salary Calculator Chart Visualizations Verified Salaries Internships H-1B Salaries Negotiation Support Compare Benefits Who's Hiring Inbox 2025 Pay Report Top Paying Companies About Us Blog Integrate Press Google Software Engineer Product Manager New York City Area Data Scientist Explore By Different Titles ⌘ K Salaries 📂 All Data 🌎 By Location 🏢 By Company 🖋 By Title 🏭️ By Industry 📍 Salary Heatmap 📈 Chart Visualizations 🔥 Real-time Percentiles 🎓 Internships 🛂 H-1B Salaries ❣️ Compare Benefits 🎬 2025 Pay Report 🏆 Top Paying Companies 💸 Calculate Meeting Cost #️⃣ Salary Calculator Contribute Add Compensation Add Company Benefits Add Level Mapping Jobs 🔍 Search Jobs 📥 Inbox Services Candidate Services 💵 Salary Negotiation 📄 Resume Review 🎁 Gift a Resume Review For Employers Talent Pool Interactive Offers Real-time Percentiles 🔥 Compensation Benchmarking API, MCP, CLI Access For Academic Research Compensation Dataset Community Internships Find the Perfect Internship, and Perfect Pay 56% of interns receive full-time offers. Discover salaries, requirements, and application links from top companies. View Guide A successful internship can result in a return internship or full-time offer for upcoming graduates. At some companies, conversion rates exceed 70%. We've summarized the key insights you'll need to secure an internship and get a full-time offer below. Timing Begin applying to Summer internships by July of the previous year. At the latest, apply to your top choices by October. Many will have filled up their intern quota by December. You can always apply to open opportunities and startups later in the new year. For smaller companies without a formal program, try cold emailing an employee or recruiter with your resume and why you're passionate about the company. For more insights, join our community! Prepare Internship interviews are typically heavily focused on raw skills. Especially high paying FAANG+ (Facebook/Meta, Amazon, Apple, Netflix, Alphabet/Google) and financial companies. For software internships, this means coding ability. Practice solving coding problems. Try using Leetcode , InterviewBit , HackerRank , Cracking the Coding Interview , etc. Side projects demonstrate raw skills and are a great way to make your resume stand out. Although you may not always have a choice, communicate the components or systems you're most passionate about . Internship assignments can vary significantly across teams / companies and managers are often willing to give interns experimental,"}
{"source_id": "CP-S077", "chunk_id": "CP-S077-0002", "chunk_index": 1, "publisher": "Levels.fyi", "title": "Internships", "category": "salary", "topics": ["internships", "salary"], "url": "https://www.levels.fyi/internships/", "resolved_url": "https://www.levels.fyi/internships/", "retrieval_method": "direct", "fetched_at": "2026-09-21T14:55:57.792630+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "text/html; charset=utf-8", "word_count": 450, "text": "internships, this means coding ability. Practice solving coding problems. Try using Leetcode , InterviewBit , HackerRank , Cracking the Coding Interview , etc. Side projects demonstrate raw skills and are a great way to make your resume stand out. Although you may not always have a choice, communicate the components or systems you're most passionate about . Internship assignments can vary significantly across teams / companies and managers are often willing to give interns experimental, interesting projects. Succeed Your mentor will have the most frequent contact with you. Managers typically rely on mentors to decide whether a return offer will be given. Chat regularly with your mentor and provide substantial project updates frequently (ex. once a day). Participate in team discussions and take interest in other projects your team is working on. Make it easy for your manager / mentor to vouch for you by delivering projects ahead of schedule and going above and beyond. Software Engineer Product Manager Product Designer Hardware Engineer Business Analyst Data Engineer Data Analyst Data Scientist Technical Program Manager Marketing Research Mechanical Engineer 2027 / 2026 Summer - 2027 Spring - 2027 Winter - 2027 Winter - 2026 Fall - 2026 Summer - 2026 Spring - 2026 Winter - 2025 Fall - 2025 Summer - 2025 Spring - 2025 Winter - 2024 Fall - 2024 Summer - 2024 Spring - 2024 Fall - 2023 Summer - 2023 Spring - 2023 Summer - 2022 Spring - 2022 Winter - 2022 Fall - 2022 Summer - 2021 Spring - 2021 Winter - 2021 Fall - 2021 Summer 