 and CCNA tracks. Internship by VTU Visvesvaraya Technological University View roles University internship cell, VTU Karnataka Visvesvaraya Technological University, Belagavi. Visvesvaraya Technological University, Karnataka’s state technical university. Its internship cell places students of affiliated engineering colleges with industry and government hosts. Internship by AMRUTAM 2.0 PIN Wells Well mapping, AMRUT 2.0 Open Well mapping field internship, AMRUT 2.0 A field internship under AMRUT 2.0. Interns survey, verify and geo-tag wells and water bodies in their city through the AMRUT app. Internship by NHIDCL Ministry of Road Transport PSU Open North-East & border highways, MoRTH corporation National Highways & Infrastructure Development Corporation. The MoRTH corporation building highways and tunnels in the North-East and border regions. Interns work on surveys, quality checks and site engineering. Internship by AICTE Research Technical Education Council Open Research & social-impact projects, AICTE AICTE’s own internship track. Placements cover industry and government project work, social and rural development initiatives, and startup or incubator projects. Internship by Land Ports Authority Ministry of Home Affairs Open Integrated Check Posts, Ministry of Home Affairs Land Ports Authority of India (LPAI). The Land Ports Authority of India, under the Ministry of Home Affairs. Interns work at Integrated Check Posts on cross-border trade, logistics and facility operations. Internship by Edunet Foundation IBM · Microsoft · Shell Open AI & cloud skilling, Edunet with IBM and Microsoft Edunet Foundation, running AICTE cohorts with IBM SkillsBuild, Microsoft and Shell. Interns take AI, cloud or"}
{"source_id": "CP-S091", "chunk_id": "CP-S091-0004", "chunk_index": 3, "publisher": "AICTE", "title": "Student Opportunities", "category": "india", "topics": ["India", "students"], "url": "https://internship.aicte-india.org/", "resolved_url": "https://internship.aicte-india.org/", "retrieval_method": "direct", "fetched_at": "2026-09-21T14:55:59.468995+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "text/html; charset=utf-8", "word_count": 450, "text": "Affairs Open Integrated Check Posts, Ministry of Home Affairs Land Ports Authority of India (LPAI). The Land Ports Authority of India, under the Ministry of Home Affairs. Interns work at Integrated Check Posts on cross-border trade, logistics and facility operations. Internship by Edunet Foundation IBM · Microsoft · Shell Open AI & cloud skilling, Edunet with IBM and Microsoft Edunet Foundation, running AICTE cohorts with IBM SkillsBuild, Microsoft and Shell. Interns take AI, cloud or green-skills tracks and finish with a mentored capstone project. Internship by Bharatiya Shikshan Mandal Education foundation Open Indian-rooted curriculum research, BSM foundation Bharatiya Shikshan Mandal, one of India’s oldest education-research foundations. Interns work on Indian-rooted curriculum, pedagogy research and education content. Internship by Microsoft Future Ready Talent View roles Azure cloud & AI, Microsoft Future Ready Talent Microsoft’s Future Ready Talent programme for Indian students. Interns work on Azure cloud, AI services and app development, ending with a live project. Internship by 1M1B Green · Salesforce Green tech & cloud Open Green skills & Salesforce cloud, 1M1B with AICTE 1M1B Green, run with Salesforce and AICTE. Interns take green-skills or Salesforce cloud training and deliver a sustainability project with a nonprofit host. Internship by Ministry of Cooperation Govt of India Open PACS & dairy co-ops, Ministry of Cooperation India’s first ministry for the cooperative sector, set up in 2021. Interns work with PACS, dairy and credit cooperatives on field surveys, data and policy research. CO Internship by Corporate Internships Fortune 500 & MNC network Open Verified corporate & PSU roles, AICTE employers Employer-verified postings from Fortune 500 India teams, Indian MNCs, PSUs and large domestic firms. Roles span engineering, data, operations and business functions. Internship by Mahagenco Maharashtra power utility Open Power plant internship, Maharashtra state utility Maharashtra State Power Generation Company. Maharashtra State Power Generation Company, the state’s largest power utility. Interns are posted to thermal, hydro and solar plants for operations and maintenance work. Internship by NCDC Ministry of Cooperation Open Co-op Development Corp., Ministry of Cooperation National Cooperative Development Corporation. The National Cooperative Development Corporation, under the Ministry of Cooperation. Interns work on cooperative finance, project appraisal and sector studies. Internship by OPPO India Generation Green sustainability Open Generation Green sustainability track, OPPO India Generation Green Sustainability Internship by OPPO. OPPO India’s Generation Green programme, one of the country’s largest handset makers. Interns work on sustainability projects alongside device R&D — hardware, embedded software and product design. Internship by Autodesk 3D CAD & design Open AutoCAD, Revit & Fusion 360, Autodesk partners Autodesk with its Indian partner firms. Interns work on live design and BIM projects using AutoCAD, Revit and Fusion 360 — architecture, manufacturing and infrastructure. Internship by Internshala Skill ecosystem"}
{"source_id": "CP-S091", "chunk_id": "CP-S091-0005", "chunk_index": 4, "publisher": "AICTE", "title": "Student Opportunities", "category": "india", "topics": ["India", "students"], "url": "https://internship.aicte-india.org/", "resolved_url": "https://internship.aicte-india.org/", "retrieval_method": "direct", "fetched_at": "2026-09-21T14:55:59.468995+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "text/html; charset=utf-8", "word_count": 450, "text": "Internship by OPPO. OPPO India’s Generation Green programme, one of the country’s largest handset makers. Interns work on sustainability projects alongside device R&D — hardware, embedded software and product design. Internship by Autodesk 3D CAD & design Open AutoCAD, Revit & Fusion 360, Autodesk partners Autodesk with its Indian partner firms. Interns work on live design and BIM projects using AutoCAD, Revit and Fusion 360 — architecture, manufacturing and infrastructure. Internship by Internshala Skill ecosystem partner Open Verified employer postings, Internshala platform India’s largest student internship platform, listing its AICTE-verified employer postings here. Roles span software, marketing, design, content and operations. Internship by EduSkills Tech academy partner Open Virtual tech cohorts, EduSkills with AICTE An AICTE skilling partner running virtual cohorts with global technology companies. Interns take a cloud, AI, data or cybersecurity track with a final project. Internship by MongoDB · SmartBridge NoSQL database skilling Open MongoDB Atlas projects, run by SmartBridge MongoDB with SmartBridge and AICTE. Interns learn MongoDB Atlas and build a full application — schema design, queries, aggregation and deployment. Internship by WhiteHat Jr Coding & STEM educator Open Curriculum & instructor roles, WhiteHat Jr One of India’s largest coding and STEM education companies. Interns work on curriculum design, learning content and instructor support for school programmes. Internship by MathWorks MATLAB & Simulink AI Open Virtual MATLAB & Simulink programme, MathWorks The MATLAB and Simulink Virtual Internship Programme. Fully online and open to any AICTE-registered student — interns work through modelling, simulation and AI projects. Internship by Wiley Edge Global tech talent Open Trained-and-placed tech roles, Wiley Edge A global tech talent accelerator. Interns are trained in software engineering, data or support skills and placed with an employer partner at the end. Internship by NHAI National Highways Authority Open Bharatmala corridor PIUs, National Highways Authority National Highways Authority of India. The National Highways Authority of India. Interns join Project Implementation Units on Bharatmala corridors — NDT bridge audits, site inspection and transport systems. Internship by IKS Ministry of Education Open Indian Knowledge Systems, Ministry of Education Indian Knowledge Systems Division. The Indian Knowledge Systems Division, set up by AICTE under the Ministry of Education. Interns document traditional Indian knowledge and map it to modern curricula. Internship by Jugaadfunda Youth innovation lab Open Student–industry challenges, Jugaadfunda lab A youth-led innovation lab and AICTE partner. Interns are paired with a real industry challenge and a mentor, and work it through to a prototype. Internship by Jeevitam Livelihood & skilling Open Rural livelihood projects, Jeevitam social enterprise A social enterprise working on rural and semi-urban livelihoods. Interns run community skill projects, field surveys and livelihood programme support. Internship by Aerospace Aviation & space employers View roles Aviation & space"}
