ords. No CV formatting pain. 02 · Get matched Instant Let the AI matcher dig Every live opening scored against your branch, year, city and skills — then ranked. You only see what you can actually get. 03 · Apply 1 tap One tap, every ministry or corporate No re-typing the same details for each requirement. One profile goes everywhere, and every application is tracked for you. 04 · Get paid Paid monthly Shortlisted, then salaried Employers respond inside the portal. Stipends are declared upfront and paid to your bank account — never negotiated in DMs. 05 · Certified Credits Walk away with credits A government-issued, QR-verifiable certificate plus credits into your ABC (Academic Bank of Credits) account. Start milestone one — it's free States & cities with postings Internships in your city Andaman Nicobar Internships in Nicobar Internships in North Middle Andaman Internships in South Andaman Andhra Pradesh Internships in Anantapur Internships in Chittoor Internships in Tirupathi Internships in East Godavari Internships in Guntur Internships in Kadapa Internships in Krishna Internships in Kurnool Internships in Nellore Internships in Prakasam Internships in Srikakulam Internships in Visakhapatnam Internships in Vizianagaram Internships in West Godavari Arunachal Pradesh Internships in Anjaw Internships in"}
