{"source_id": "CP-S091", "chunk_id": "CP-S091-0015", "chunk_index": 14, "publisher": "AICTE", "title": "Student Opportunities", "category": "india", "topics": ["India", "students"], "url": "https://internship.aicte-india.org/", "resolved_url": "https://internship.aicte-india.org/", "retrieval_method": "direct", "fetched_at": "2026-09-21T14:55:59.468995+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "text/html; charset=utf-8", "word_count": 450, "text": "in Paschim Medinipur Internships in Purba Bardhaman Internships in Purba Medinipur Internships in Purulia Internships in South 24 Parganas Internships in Uttar Dinajpur Government internships Internship by stream Internships for every branch you study Engineering and professional streams, each with thousands of verified openings from ministries, PSUs, Fortune 500s and MSMEs. Pick yours and go. View all internships 01 Software · Cloud · Web Computer Science & IT Ship production code with C-DAC, Google, TCS Research and verified tech teams across India. Full-stack Mobile DevOps Backend Explore stream 02 ML · GenAI · Analytics AI & Data Science Train models, build agents and wrangle national-scale datasets with research labs and startups. ML Engineer Data Analyst GenAI MLOps Explore stream 03 VLSI · Embedded · IoT Electronics & Communication From chip design at semiconductor fabs to IoT stacks for smart cities and 5G rollouts. VLSI Embedded IoT RF Explore stream 04 Design · Robotics · Defence Mechanical & Aerospace CAD, CFD, drones and propulsion with HAL, Tata, Mahindra and national labs. CAD/CAE Robotics Manufacturing Aero Explore stream 05 Smart Cities · Infra · BIM Civil & Architecture Plan metros, bridges and 100 Smart Cities with TULIP urban bodies, L&T and NHAI. Structural Urban Planning BIM Surveying Explore stream 06 Pharma · Labs · Process Chemical & Biotechnology Bench to plant — research labs, vaccine makers, refineries and green-chemistry startups. Process Eng. Bio-tech Pharma QA R&D Explore stream 07 Power · Solar · EV Electrical & Energy Wire the energy transition — grid, solar parks, EV charging and battery labs. Power Systems Renewables EV Controls Explore stream 08 Brand · UX · Content Design, Media & Marketing Craft campaigns, interfaces and stories for brands, studios and government missions. Graphic UI/UX Social Media Video Explore stream More streams Not an engineer? We have you covered too. Biotechnology Agriculture Pharmacy Management & Commerce Law Hotel Management Aeronautical Automobile Instrumentation Textile Mining Petroleum Environmental Food Technology Mass Communication Applied Sciences View all streams National Internship Mission The Government of India’s vision is to provide 1 crore internships by 2027 Delivered through the National Internship Portal by AICTE, Ministry of Education — for AICTE, UGC, IGNOU and other students. NEP 2020 ABC credits that follow you, not the college Credits earned on a completed internship are deposited into your Academic Bank of Credits account against your APAAR / ABC ID. Change college, take a break, move university — the credits stay with you and count towards your degree. Internship ABC account Your degree Fits your timetable Weekly and monthly internships, not just semester-long ones Short weekly assignments you can finish inside a break, the standard monthly formats across our government missions and industry partners, and full"}
{"source_id": "CP-S091", "chunk_id": "CP-S091-0016", "chunk_index": 15, "publisher": "AICTE", "title": "Student Opportunities", "category": "india", "topics": ["India", "students"], "url": "https://internship.aicte-india.org/", "resolved_url": "https://internship.aicte-india.org/", "retrieval_method": "direct", "fetched_at": "2026-09-21T14:55:59.468995+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "text/html; charset=utf-8", "word_count": 450, "text": "on a completed internship are deposited into your Academic Bank of Credits account against your APAAR / ABC ID. Change college, take a break, move university — the credits stay with you and count towards your degree. Internship ABC account Your degree Fits your timetable Weekly and monthly internships, not just semester-long ones Short weekly assignments you can finish inside a break, the standard monthly formats across our government missions and industry partners, and full semester projects — all on the same portal. Weekly 1 – 4 weeks Monthly 1 – 6 months Semester 6 months + Verifiable by anyone A QR-based certificate a recruiter can check in seconds Finish your internship and the portal issues a government certificate carrying a QR code. Scanning it opens this portal's own verification page — the issuing ministry, the organisation and the exact period, straight from the record. Scan to verify Genuine Straight answers The questions you'd ask a senior Still stuck? The national helpdesk answers in all 22 scheduled languages, Monday to Friday. Toll free · 011-29581423 Mon–Fri · 9am–6pm IST internship@aicte-india.org Replies within 48 hours Create your profile Is this genuinely free, or is there a catch later? Free, end to end. Registration, applications, shortlisting and the completion certificate cost a student ₹0. The portal is funded by AICTE under the Ministry of Education. If any website, agent or “placement consultant” asks you to pay to apply through the National Internship Portal, it is a scam — report it to internship@aicte-india.org. I am only in second year. Am I even eligible? Will my university count this as my mandatory internship? Is the stipend actually guaranteed? Can I do this remotely from my hometown? I am not from an IIT or NIT. Realistically, do I stand a chance? How long does selection usually take? How many internships can I apply to at once? Applications open right now Somebody is going to get that internship. Make it you. Verified openings from every scheme on the portal, refreshed daily. Build your profile once and the matcher keeps working while you sleep. Create my free profile I want to hire interns Sign-up takes 4 minutes Cost to students ₹0 forever Employer vetting 100% verified An initiative of AICTE · Ministry of Education · Government of India National Internship Portal All India Council for Technical Education One crore verified internships for Indian students by 2027. Built and run by AICTE under the Ministry of Education, Government of India — free for every student, in all 22 scheduled languages. Govt of India verified ₹0 for students Explore All internships Remote & hybrid Highest stipend ₹₹₹ Closing this week Browse by state Verify a certificate Flagship missions Indian"}
