{"source_id": "CP-S097", "chunk_id": "CP-S097-0001", "chunk_index": 0, "publisher": "GitHub Skills", "title": "GitHub Skills", "category": "learning", "topics": ["GitHub", "software", "learning"], "url": "https://skills.github.com/", "resolved_url": "https://skills.github.com/", "retrieval_method": "reader_fallback", "fetched_at": "2026-09-21T14:56:00.435310+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "text/plain", "word_count": 450, "text": "Title: GitHub Learn: Your Personalized Learning Experience URL Source: https://skills.github.com/ Markdown Content: [Skip to content](https://skills.github.com/#start-of-content) 1. [](https://github.com/) 2. / 3. [GitHub Learn](https://skills.github.com/) * [Courses](https://skills.github.com/courses) * [Skills](https://skills.github.com/skills) * [Credentials](https://skills.github.com/credentials) * [Learning pathways](https://skills.github.com/learning-pathways) * [Product guides](https://skills.github.com/product-guides) * [GitHub Well-Architected](https://skills.github.com/well-architected) * [Events and webinars](https://skills.github.com/events) * More * [Product guides](https://skills.github.com/product-guides) * [GitHub Well-Architected](https://skills.github.com/well-architected) * [Events and webinars](https://skills.github.com/events) [Sign In](https://skills.github.com/auth/signin) On this Page GitHub Skills # Learn GitHub within GitHub Learn how to use GitHub with interactive courses designed for beginners and experts. ![Image 2: Hero illustration](https://skills.github.com/assets/hero-skills-CDyEmYXv.png) ## First day on GitHub Kickstart your GitHub journey with quick, practical courses that cover the basics and help you ship with confidence. ### [Introduction to GitHub](https://github.com/skills/introduction-to-github) Get started using GitHub in less than an hour. Get Started ### [Communicate using Markdown](https://github.com/skills/communicate-using-markdown) Organize ideas and collaborate using Markdown, a lightweight language for text formatting. Get Started ### [GitHub Pages](https://github.com/skills/github-pages) Create a site or blog from your GitHub repositories with GitHub Pages. Get Started ## First week on GitHub Build momentum with workflows, collaboration techniques, and tools that help you go from beginner to contributor in no time. ### [Introduction to Git](https://github.com/skills/introduction-to-git) Use Git version control to work on a game using command line (CLI) and VS Code. Get Started ### [Review pull requests](https://github.com/skills/review-pull-requests) Collaborate and work together on GitHub. Get Started ### [Resolve merge conflicts](https://github.com/skills/resolve-merge-conflicts) Learn why conflicts happen and how to resolve them. Get Started ### [Code with Codespaces](https://github.com/skills/code-with-codespaces) Develop code using GitHub Codespaces and Visual Studio Code. Get Started ### [Introduction to Repository Management](https://github.com/skills/introduction-to-repository-management) Learn the basics of several features for a collaborative, friendly, and healthy project. Get Started ## Take flight with GitHub Copilot Explore how AI can supercharge your coding. Learn to pair program with GitHub Copilot and extend it to fit your workflow. ### [Getting Started with GitHub Copilot](https://github.com/skills/getting-started-with-github-copilot) Learn, build, debug, and ship faster than ever with your favorite AI pair programmer. Get Started ### [Customize your GitHub Copilot Experience](https://github.com/skills/customize-your-github-copilot-experience) Customize Copilot with custom instructions, prompts, and chat modes for your development workflows. Get Started ### [GitHub Copilot Code Review](https://github.com/skills/copilot-code-review) Scale feedback, promote code quality, and catch issues before they reach production. Get Started ### [Integrate MCP with GitHub Copilot](https://github.com/skills/integrate-mcp-with-copilot) Give GitHub Copilot more tools to enhance its capabilities. Get Started ### [Expand your team with Copilot coding agent](https://github.com/skills/expand-your-team-with-copilot) Let Copilot coding agent tackle your issues directly on GitHub. No coding environment needed. Get Started ### [Create Applications with the Copilot CLI](https://github.com/skills/create-applications-with-the-copilot-cli) Use GitHub Copilot CLI to manage issues and build a Node.js calculator application. Get Started ### [Modernize your legacy code with GitHub Copilot](https://github.com/skills/modernize-your-legacy-code-with-github-copilot) Modernize a school's legacy accounting system from Cobol to Node.js with the help of GitHub Copilot. Get Started ### [Scale institutional knowledge with GitHub Copilot Spaces](https://github.com/skills/scale-institutional-knowledge-using-copilot-spaces) Use"}
{"source_id": "CP-S097", "chunk_id": "CP-S097-0002", "chunk_index": 1, "publisher": "GitHub Skills", "title": "GitHub Skills", "category": "learning", "topics": ["GitHub", "software", "learning"], "url": "https://skills.github.com/", "resolved_url": "https://skills.github.com/", "retrieval_method": "reader_fallback", "fetched_at": "2026-09-21T14:56:00.435310+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "text/plain", "word_count": 450, "text": "coding agent](https://github.com/skills/expand-your-team-with-copilot) Let Copilot coding agent tackle your issues directly on GitHub. No coding environment needed. Get Started ### [Create Applications with the Copilot CLI](https://github.com/skills/create-applications-with-the-copilot-cli) Use GitHub Copilot CLI to manage issues and build a Node.js calculator application. Get Started ### [Modernize your legacy code with GitHub Copilot](https://github.com/skills/modernize-your-legacy-code-with-github-copilot) Modernize a school's legacy accounting system from Cobol to Node.js with the help of GitHub Copilot. Get Started ### [Scale institutional knowledge with GitHub Copilot Spaces](https://github.com/skills/scale-institutional-knowledge-using-copilot-spaces) Use GitHub Copilot Spaces to help onboard new team members and share institutional knowledge across your organization. Get Started ### [Build applications with GitHub Copilot agent mode](https://github.com/skills/build-applications-w-copilot-agent-mode) Build multi-tier applications that use GitHub Copilot agent mode to interact with users and external systems. Get Started ### [Agentic Workflows that Read the Room](https://github.com/skills/agentic-workflows-that-read-the-room) Install the gh aw extension, author an agentic workflow in Markdown, and run it so proposed changes flow through pull requests. Get Started ### [Agent Orchestration Build Your AI Dream Team](https://github.com/skills/agent-orchestration-build-your-ai-dream-team) Use custom agents in GitHub Copilot CLI to plan, design, build, validate, and hand off Mona's Project Pulse dashboard. Get Started ### [Idea to Merge with the Copilot App](https://github.com/skills/idea-to-merge-with-the-copilot-app) Take an idea from a session to a merged pull request—entirely in the GitHub Copilot App. Get Started ## Automate workflows with GitHub Actions Automate your development process with powerful, flexible workflows—from CI/CD to publishing packages and more. ### [Hello GitHub Actions](https://github.com/skills/hello-github-actions) Create a GitHub Action and use it in a workflow. Get Started ### [Test with Actions](https://github.com/skills/test-with-actions) Create workflows that enable you to use Continuous Integration (CI) for your projects. Get Started ### [Write JavaScript Actions](https://github.com/skills/write-javascript-actions) Write your own GitHub JavaScript Action. Get Started ### [Publish Docker Images](https://github.com/skills/publish-docker-images) Build and publish Docker images using GitHub Actions. Get Started ### [Create and use reusable workflows](https://github.com/skills/reusable-workflows) Create GitHub Actions workflows that can be called from other workflows. Get Started ### [Work with Workflow Artifacts](https://github.com/skills/workflow-artifacts) Learn how to upload, preview, download, and reuse workflow artifacts in GitHub Actions. Get Started ## Code security and analysis Learn how to find vulnerabilities, secure your codebase, and ship with confidence—right from your development environment. ### [Secure your repository supply chain](https://github.com/skills/secure-repository-supply-chain) Secure your supply chain, patch dependency vulnerabilities. Get Started ### [Introduction to CodeQL](https://github.com/skills/introduction-to-codeql) Learn how to enable CodeQL to secure your code. Get Started ### [Introduction to secret scanning](https://github.com/skills/introduction-to-secret-scanning) Enable secret scanning and take a feature tour. Get Started ### [Secure code game](https://github.com/skills/secure-code-game) Learn about software security in a fun, educational environment. Get Started ### [Ship with Quality](https://github.com/skills/ship-with-quality) Ship faster with automated quality signals to identify defects, monitor test coverage, and enforce checks during pull requests. Get Started ## Switch to GitHub Migrate your projects from other platforms to GitHub using tools and best practices for seamless transitions. ###"}
