{"source_id": "CP-S098", "chunk_id": "CP-S098-0001", "chunk_index": 0, "publisher": "AWS Skill Builder", "title": "AWS Skill Builder", "category": "learning", "topics": ["cloud", "AWS", "learning"], "url": "https://skillbuilder.aws/", "resolved_url": "https://skillbuilder.aws/", "retrieval_method": "reader_fallback", "fetched_at": "2026-09-21T14:56:00.518486+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "text/plain", "word_count": 450, "text": "Title: Home - AWS Skill Builder URL Source: https://skillbuilder.aws/ Markdown Content: ## I'm building my AWS Cloud foundation Start with 1,000+ free learning resources. No experience needed. ## I want to advance my career Build job-ready skills and earn industry-recognized AWS Certifications that open doors. ## I'm learning with my team Learn together, grow faster, and track your team's progress. ## What's New in Skill Builder Discover the latest features and experiences ## Build AI Skills That Matter. From foundational AI concepts to advanced agentic AI implementation, learn the skills your organization needs. ### Production-Ready AI Training Build hands-on experience with Amazon Bedrock, Amazon SageMaker, and the AI services you'll use to deploy real solutions. ### Choose Your Depth Foundational awareness for business leaders or advanced technical skills for builders—learn based on your role. ## Learn by Building Practice AWS in a live environment, risk-free ![Image 1: AWS SimuLearn](https://skillbuilderstaticpages.xps.skillbuilder.aws/images/sandbox-simulearn.png) ### AWS SimuLearn Work through AI-powered assignments that walk you through the complete professional journey across different industries and roles: understand the customer problem, architect a solution, then build it hands-on. ![Image 2: AWS Builder Labs](https://skillbuilderstaticpages.xps.skillbuilder.aws/images/sandbox-labs.jpeg) ### AWS Builder Labs Step into a live AWS environment and build hands-on with guided labs. ## Build Skills Your Way. From digital courses, to immersive role-based practice, to hands-on skills validation, find the experience that fits your goals. ## Scale Your Team's Technical Depth. Give your team the tools to build AWS expertise together. Skill Builder Team subscription unlocks collaborative learning, enterprise analytics, and AI-powered instant lab generation. ### Lab Maker Generate instant, personalized labs from natural language prompts for just-in-time learning. ### Cohorts Studio Create exam prep study groups, AI bootcamps, or team competitions in minutes. ### Team Dashboards See proficiency levels across your entire org at a glance. ### Group Challenges Foster healthy competition with team-based milestones. ### ROI Tracking Turn training from a \"compliance check\" into a strategic advantage. ## From Start to AWS Certified Prepare for your exam with confidence. Follow a guided 4-step plan with practice questions, hands-on labs, and AWS Certification Official Practice Exams. 1 ### Get to know the exam 2 ### Refresh your AWS knowledge and skills 3 ### Review and practice for your exam 4 ### Assess your exam readiness ## Real Skills, Real Career Growth > \"I probably would not be in the position I am had I not used the content that was provided by AWS Training and Certification. It's helped me achieve several certifications so I can help people achieve the same level of professional growth that I've been working towards.\" — Chris Gonzalez, Former Band Director, Now Cloud Solutions Architect at Major Financial Services Firm [Video 3](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NoHbvcNQlOQ) ![Image 3](https://img.youtube.com/vi/NoHbvcNQlOQ/maxresdefault.jpg) Video Player"}
